// What a frame asks to be drawn: colours, shapes, and the painter that collects
// them.
//
// Nothing here rasterises anything. A frame produces a list of shapes and the
// backend decides how to put them on a screen, which is what keeps the library
// able to run — and be tested — where there is no screen at all.
import {
  "moonbitstack/moonegui/emath",
}
